// Original game: https://gd.games/penusbmic/bullet-bunny
// I just prompted the ai helper to make a clone of that game, except using three.js (for 3D).
// I attached some screenshots and told it to use the vision tool to compare them side-by-side and make sure the vision tool says it's visually impressive.
// And then I spammed the prompt below at it like 20 times with the "then do this" button, and playtested it every now and then:
//   "Keep hunting for and fixing any differences that could affect balance/difficulty/gamplay/etc. and port them from the original to our version. If you find nothing, then no changes are required, of course."
// If you want to add any features or new perks/upgrades to you can just ask the AI helper to add them.